  "published": "2026-06-23T21:21:23.84Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "5.0.0 — full rewrite on .NET 10 + CommandLine.EasyBuilder. Commands: sync, clean, watch, init. `sync --dry-run` previews and `--confirm` asks first; `clean` confirms by default (`--noconfirm`/`-y` to skip). Bare `filesync <config>` opens a preloaded REPL. JSON or YAML config — `.filesync` and `.filesync.{yaml,yml,json}` are all auto-discovered. Directory and Azure Blob targets (FTP and Amazon S3 scaffolded, not yet implemented); repeatable `--filter`/`--exclude`.",
